---
import courseVersion from "../../../course-version.json";

const expectedCourseVersion = courseVersion.course_version;
---

<section
  class="context-budget-lab"
  data-context-budget
  data-course-version={expectedCourseVersion}
  aria-labelledby="context-budget-title"
>
  <div class="context-budget-lab__heading">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">模块 5A · 上下文工程</p>
      <h2 id="context-budget-title">选择工作集，再看谁被挤出去</h2>
    </div>
    <span class="context-budget-lab__version">budget v1 · {expectedCourseVersion}</span>
  </div>

  <p class="context-budget-lab__lead">
    这是一个离线、确定性的教学模拟，不调用真实模型。每个数字只是相对占用量；它把当前任务、历史、受控 Memory、工具结果和无关噪声放进同一工作集，再按优先级报告容量、遗漏和挤占。
  </p>

  <noscript>
    <section class="context-budget-lab__noscript" aria-labelledby="context-budget-noscript-title">
      <h3 id="context-budget-noscript-title">交互控件需要 JavaScript</h3>
      <p>
        未启用 JavaScript 时不能调整数字或导出证据，但以下固定边界仍说明实验的判断方式：输入预算 = 上下文容量 − 输出预留；输入工作集超出预算时会出现“上下文不足”，无关内容占比高时会出现“上下文污染”，低优先级片段被截掉时会出现“相关内容被挤占”。
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>系统与规则、当前任务优先于可选的历史、Memory、工具结果和噪声。</li>
        <li>Memory 只表示主动选入的摘要，不等于全部历史对话。</li>
        <li>本实验的数字是课程夹具，不代表任何厂商模型的真实上下文上限。</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </noscript>

  <div class="context-budget-lab__model-grid" aria-label="上下文、历史与 Memory 的边界">
    <article>
      <h3>Context</h3>
      <p>当前推理能看到的有限工作集；容量会被规则、任务、历史和工具结果共同消耗。</p>
    </article>
    <article>
      <h3>History</h3>
      <p>当前会话已经发生的轮次；它不是自动值得永久保留的知识。</p>
    </article>
    <article>
      <h3>Memory</h3>
      <p>为后续任务受控保留的信息；只有选入当前工作集的摘要才会占本次预算。</p>
    </article>
    <article>
      <h3>Noise</h3>
      <p>无关、过期或重复内容；即使能塞进窗口，也可能稀释当前决策所需信息。</p>
    </article>
  </div>

  <form class="context-budget-lab__inputs" data-context-budget-form>
    <fieldset>
      <legend>1. 调整边界与片段占用量</legend>

      <label for="context-budget-capacity">上下文容量（相对单位）</label>
      <input id="context-budget-capacity" name="capacity" type="number" min="64" max="1024" step="1" value="256" required />

      <label for="context-budget-reserve">输出预留</label>
      <input id="context-budget-reserve" name="outputReserve" type="number" min="0" max="512" step="1" value="64" required />

      <label for="context-budget-instructions">系统与规则</label>
      <input id="context-budget-instructions" name="instructions" type="number" min="0" max="512" step="1" value="24" required />

      <label for="context-budget-task">当前任务</label>
      <input id="context-budget-task" name="task" type="number" min="0" max="512" step="1" value="48" required />

      <label for="context-budget-history">对话历史</label>
      <input id="context-budget-history" name="history" type="number" min="0" max="512" step="1" value="64" required />

      <label for="context-budget-memory">Memory 摘要</label>
      <input id="context-budget-memory" name="memory" type="number" min="0" max="512" step="1" value="32" required />

      <label for="context-budget-tools">工具结果</label>
      <input id="context-budget-tools" name="tools" type="number" min="0" max="512" step="1" value="16" required />

      <label for="context-budget-noise">无关或过期噪声</label>
      <input id="context-budget-noise" name="noise" type="number" min="0" max="512" step="1" value="0" required />
    </fieldset>

    <fieldset class="context-budget-lab__selection">
      <legend>选择本轮工作集（系统与当前任务始终保留）</legend>
      <label><input id="context-budget-include-history" type="checkbox" checked /> 纳入对话历史</label>
      <label><input id="context-budget-include-memory" type="checkbox" checked /> 纳入 Memory 摘要</label>
      <label><input id="context-budget-include-tools" type="checkbox" checked /> 纳入工具结果</label>
      <label><input id="context-budget-include-noise" type="checkbox" /> 纳入无关/过期噪声</label>
    </fieldset>

    <fieldset class="context-budget-lab__prediction">
      <legend>2. 先预测主要风险，再运行</legend>
      <label for="context-budget-prediction">你的预测</label>
      <select id="context-budget-prediction">
        <option value="ready">工作集可用</option>
        <option value="insufficient">上下文不足</option>
        <option value="pollution">上下文污染</option>
        <option value="crowding">相关内容被挤占</option>
      </select>
      <button type="submit" data-run-context-budget>运行离线模拟</button>
    </fieldset>
  </form>

  <div class="context-budget-lab__presets" aria-labelledby="context-budget-presets-title">
    <h3 id="context-budget-presets-title">快速复现实验分支</h3>
    <p>这些按钮只是填入可重复的夹具输入；也可以自行调整每个边界值。</p>
    <div class="context-budget-lab__preset-buttons">
      <button type="button" data-context-budget-preset="normal">正常工作集</button>
      <button type="button" data-context-budget-preset="insufficient">上下文不足</button>
      <button type="button" data-context-budget-preset="pollution">注入污染</button>
      <button type="button" data-context-budget-preset="crowding">制造挤占</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="context-budget-lab__status" data-context-budget-status role="status" aria-live="polite">
    请先预测，再运行模拟。
  </p>

  <section class="context-budget-lab__result" aria-labelledby="context-budget-result-title">
    <div class="context-budget-lab__result-heading">
      <h3 id="context-budget-result-title">可解释结果</h3>
      <span data-context-budget-primary>工作集可用</span>
    </div>
    <dl class="context-budget-lab__metrics" data-context-budget-metrics>
      <div><dt>输入预算</dt><dd data-metric="input-budget">—</dd></div>
      <div><dt>选入工作集</dt><dd data-metric="selected-total">—</dd></div>
      <div><dt>保留</dt><dd data-metric="retained-total">—</dd></div>
      <div><dt>未保留</dt><dd data-metric="dropped-total">—</dd></div>
      <div><dt>噪声占比</dt><dd data-metric="pollution-percent">—</dd></div>
      <div><dt>相关信息占比</dt><dd data-metric="relevance-percent">—</dd></div>
    </dl>
    <div class="context-budget-lab__findings" aria-live="polite">
      <h4>风险信号（文字不是颜色的替代品）</h4>
      <ul data-context-budget-findings>
        <li>运行后会显示“上下文不足”“上下文污染”或“相关内容被挤占”的文字解释。</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="context-budget-lab__segments">
      <h4>各片段保留情况</h4>
      <table>
        <caption>按优先级分配输入预算；“未保留”表示被挤出当前工作集。</caption>
        <thead><tr><th scope="col">片段</th><th scope="col">角色</th><th scope="col">选入</th><th scope="col">保留</th><th scope="col">未保留</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody data-context-budget-segments><tr><td colspan="5">运行后显示确定性分配。</td></tr></tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="context-budget-lab__controls">
    <button type="button" data-record-context-budget>记录本次观察</button>
    <button type="button" data-export-context-budget>导出匿名证据</button>
  </div>
  <p class="context-budget-lab__evidence" data-context-budget-evidence-status role="status" aria-live="polite">
    已记录 0 次观察；需要覆盖三类风险与至少一个边界值后再导出。
  </p>
  <p class="context-budget-lab__privacy">
    证据只记录运行编号、风险类别和是否触碰边界，不记录输入文本、路径、密钥、原始数据或模型响应；模拟完全离线。
  </p>
</section>

<script>
  // @ts-nocheck
  import {
    CONTEXT_BUDGET_PRESETS,
    DEFAULT_CONTEXT_BUDGET_INPUT,
    buildContextBudgetEvidence,
    createContextBudgetSession,
    describeContextBudgetResult,
    recordContextBudgetObservation,
    updateContextBudgetSession,
  } from "../lib/context-budget.mjs";

  const root = document.querySelector("[data-context-budget]");
  if (root instanceof HTMLElement) {
    const form = root.querySelector("[data-context-budget-form]");
    const status = root.querySelector("[data-context-budget-status]");
    const evidenceStatus = root.querySelector("[data-context-budget-evidence-status]");
    const primary = root.querySelector("[data-context-budget-primary]");
    const findings = root.querySelector("[data-context-budget-findings]");
    const segments = root.querySelector("[data-context-budget-segments]");
    const prediction = root.querySelector("#context-budget-prediction");
    const recordButton = root.querySelector("[data-record-context-budget]");
    const exportButton = root.querySelector("[data-export-context-budget]");
    const numericFields = ["capacity", "outputReserve", "instructions", "task", "history", "memory", "tools", "noise"];
    const fieldIds = Object.fromEntries(numericFields.map((name) => [name, `#context-budget-${name === "outputReserve" ? "reserve" : name}`]));
    let session = createContextBudgetSession(DEFAULT_CONTEXT_BUDGET_INPUT);
    let predictionCorrect = null;

    const setMessage = (element, message, kind = "") => {
      if (!(element instanceof HTMLElement)) return;
      element.textContent = message;
      element.dataset.status = kind;
    };

    const readInput = () => ({
      capacity: Number(root.querySelector(fieldIds.capacity)?.value),
      outputReserve: Number(root.querySelector(fieldIds.outputReserve)?.value),
      instructions: Number(root.querySelector(fieldIds.instructions)?.value),
      task: Number(root.querySelector(fieldIds.task)?.value),
      history: Number(root.querySelector(fieldIds.history)?.value),
      memory: Number(root.querySelector(fieldIds.memory)?.value),
      tools: Number(root.querySelector(fieldIds.tools)?.value),
      noise: Number(root.querySelector(fieldIds.noise)?.value),
      includeHistory: root.querySelector("#context-budget-include-history")?.checked ?? false,
      includeMemory: root.querySelector("#context-budget-include-memory")?.checked ?? false,
      includeTools: root.querySelector("#context-budget-include-tools")?.checked ?? false,
      includeNoise: root.querySelector("#context-budget-include-noise")?.checked ?? false,
    });

    const writeInput = (input) => {
      for (const name of numericFields) {
        const element = root.querySelector(fieldIds[name]);
        if (element instanceof HTMLInputElement) element.value = String(input[name]);
      }
      for (const [id, value] of [
        ["#context-budget-include-history", input.includeHistory],
        ["#context-budget-include-memory", input.includeMemory],
        ["#context-budget-include-tools", input.includeTools],
        ["#context-budget-include-noise", input.includeNoise],
      ]) {
        const element = root.querySelector(id);
        if (element instanceof HTMLInputElement) element.checked = value;
      }
    };

    const updateMetrics = () => {
      const values = {
        "input-budget": session.result.budget.inputBudget,
        "selected-total": session.result.budget.selectedTotal,
        "retained-total": session.result.budget.retainedTotal,
        "dropped-total": session.result.budget.droppedTotal,
        "pollution-percent": `${session.result.ratios.pollutionPercent}%`,
        "relevance-percent": `${session.result.ratios.relevancePercent}%`,
      };
      for (const [key, value] of Object.entries(values)) {
        const element = root.querySelector(`[data-metric="${key}"]`);
        if (element) element.textContent = String(value);
      }
    };

    const render = () => {
      const result = session.result;
      updateMetrics();
      if (primary instanceof HTMLElement) {
        primary.textContent = result.findingDetails[0].label;
        primary.dataset.finding = result.primaryFinding;
      }
      if (findings instanceof HTMLElement) {
        findings.replaceChildren();
        for (const item of result.findingDetails) {
          const listItem = document.createElement("li");
          listItem.dataset.finding = item.id;
          const heading = document.createElement("strong");
          heading.textContent = item.label;
          const detail = document.createElement("p");
          detail.textContent = item.detail;
          listItem.append(heading, detail);
          findings.append(listItem);
        }
      }
      if (segments instanceof HTMLElement) {
        segments.replaceChildren();
        for (const segment of result.segments) {
          const row = document.createElement("tr");
          const values = [
            segment.label,
            segment.role,
            segment.selected ? `${segment.requested}` : "未选入",
            `${segment.kept}`,
            `${segment.dropped}`,
          ];
          values.forEach((value, index) => {
            const cell = document.createElement("td");
            if (index === 0) cell.setAttribute("data-segment", segment.id);
            cell.textContent = value;
            row.append(cell);
          });
          segments.append(row);
        }
      }
      if (evidenceStatus instanceof HTMLElement) {
        const observed = new Set(session.runs.flatMap((run) => run.findings));
        evidenceStatus.textContent = `已记录 ${session.runs.length} 次观察；已覆盖 ${["insufficient", "pollution", "crowding"].filter((id) => observed.has(id)).length} / 3 类风险。`;
      }
    };

    const runInput = () => {
      try {
        session = updateContextBudgetSession(session, readInput());
        const selectedPrediction = prediction instanceof HTMLSelectElement ? prediction.value : "ready";
        predictionCorrect = selectedPrediction === session.result.primaryFinding;
        const predictionText = predictionCorrect ? "预测命中" : `预测未命中，实际主要信号是“${session.result.findingDetails[0].label}”`;
        setMessage(status, `${predictionText}。${describeContextBudgetResult(session.result)}`, predictionCorrect ? "success" : "warning");
        render();
      } catch (error) {
        setMessage(status, `无法运行模拟：${error instanceof Error ? error.message : "输入无效"}`, "error");
      }
    };

    form?.addEventListener("submit", (event) => {
      event.preventDefault();
      runInput();
    });

    root.querySelectorAll("[data-context-budget-preset]").forEach((button) => {
      button.addEventListener("click", () => {
        const name = button.getAttribute("data-context-budget-preset");
        const preset = name ? CONTEXT_BUDGET_PRESETS[name] : null;
        if (!preset) return;
        writeInput(preset);
        runInput();
      });
    });

    recordButton?.addEventListener("click", () => {
      session = recordContextBudgetObservation(session);
      setMessage(status, `已记录 ${session.lastRun.finding} 观察；可以改变输入继续记录。`, "success");
      render();
    });

    exportButton?.addEventListener("click", () => {
      try {
        const evidence = buildContextBudgetEvidence(session, { courseVersion: root.dataset.courseVersion ?? "" });
        const encoded = `${JSON.stringify(evidence, null, 2)}\n`;
        const blob = new Blob([encoded], { type: "application/json" });
        const url = URL.createObjectURL(blob);
        const link = document.createElement("a");
        link.href = url;
        link.download = "t14-context-budget-evidence.json";
        link.click();
        URL.revokeObjectURL(url);
        window.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent("context-budget:evidence", { detail: evidence }));
        setMessage(evidenceStatus, `已导出 ${evidence.result} 匿名证据；可交给本地 course_check。`, "success");
      } catch (error) {
        setMessage(evidenceStatus, `无法导出证据：${error instanceof Error ? error.message : "证据生成失败"}`, "error");
      }
    });

    render();
  }
</script>
